      "rationale": "Base equation for the declarative scanGroups fold: consuming an empty suffix returns the accumulated output sequence.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-b171bbb955f7651b57177d9cf1f07a66354aea7dd245779160b3153ed3292907",
      "start_line": 10,
      "text": "  rule scanGroups(.IntSeq, _CUR:IntSeq, _DEPTH:Int, ACC:ValSeq)\n    => ACC"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [],
      "classification": "DEFINITION",
      "end_line": 14,
